#: ../../source/mp/operator.rst:158
msgid ""
"**hostIPC: true** -- CUDA IPC (``cudaIpcOpenMemHandle``) needs a shared "
"IPC namespace between vLLM and LMCache."
msgstr ""
"**hostIPC: true** -- CUDA IPC (``cudaIpcOpenMemHandle``) 需要在 vLLM 和 "
