msgid ""
"**PYTHONHASHSEED=0** -- Ensures deterministic token hashing so vLLM and "
"LMCache produce consistent cache keys."
msgstr "**PYTHONHASHSEED=0** -- 确保确定性令牌哈希，以便 vLLM 和 LMCache 生成一致的缓存键。"

#: ../../source/mp/operator.rst:162
msgid ""
"**ConfigMap mount** -- The ``$(cat ...)`` pattern reads the connection "
"JSON inline.  The ConfigMap name is always ``<LMCacheEngine "
"name>-connection``."
msgstr ""
"**ConfigMap挂载** -- ``$(cat ...)`` 模式在线读取连接 JSON。ConfigMap 名称始终为 "
"``<LMCacheEngine name>-connection``。"

#: ../../source/mp/operator.rst:164
