#: ../../source/mp/operator.rst:784
msgid "LMCacheCoordinator"
msgstr "LMCacheCoordinator"

#: ../../source/mp/operator.rst:786
msgid ""
"The ``LMCacheCoordinator`` CRD runs the **mp coordinator** -- a fleet-"
"wide HTTP service that tracks mp server instances, evicts those whose "
"heartbeats lapse, performs L2 quota eviction, and hosts the global "
"CacheBlend fingerprint directory.  It is a plain (non-GPU) ``Deployment``"
" exposed through a ClusterIP Service; engines reach it via "
"``coordinator.ref`` or ``coordinator.url``."
msgstr "``LMCacheCoordinator`` CRD 运行 **mp 协调器**——一个全局 HTTP 服务，用于跟踪 mp 服务器实例，逐出心跳失效的实例，执行 L2 配额逐出，并托管全局 CacheBlend 指纹目录。它是一个通过 ClusterIP 服务暴露的普通（非 GPU）``Deployment``；引擎通过 ``coordinator.ref`` 或 ``coordinator.url`` 访问它。"

